sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant HTTP as REST / GraphQL middleware
    participant Handler as Handler or gqlgen server
    participant OTel as Tracer provider
    participant Collector
    participant Jaeger

    Client->>HTTP: Request with optional traceparent
    HTTP->>OTel: Extract context and start server span
    HTTP->>Handler: Request context containing span
    Handler-->>HTTP: Existing response
    HTTP->>HTTP: Set X-Trace-ID
    HTTP->>OTel: End server span
    OTel->>Collector: OTLP/HTTP batch
    Collector->>Jaeger: Export trace
    HTTP-->>Client: Existing response + X-Trace-ID